Meadowbrook's snooker room is one of the few places in the Dartington and Totnes area where you can hire a full-size snooker table by the hour. It's a great space for a casual game with friends, regular practice, or organised club sessions.

The room is located upstairs in the main Meadowbrook building. You receive an access code when you book — no need to check in with staff.

Please see the booking system below for current pricing and availability.
